{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"fiend","model_identifier":"fiend","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# fiend\n\nFiend (C2), walker, 2.2 m = 78 u to the top of the head (horn curls to 84 u).\n\nA heavily muscled red demon soldier: brick-red skin with glowing orange cracks, curled black horns, a fanged underbite, burning yellow eyes, an iron shoulder plate with a spike on a chest strap, an iron-banded leather loincloth, black claws and a jagged black iron cleaver. Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names (scaled up).\n\n- Cubes: 39 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -22.0..20.0, y 0.0..82.0, z -8.0..7.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 30 x 80 x 18 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1.1 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.7 | loop |  |\n| `attack_cleave` | 1.3 | once | key 0.55 s: flat sweep right-to-left in front (hits an arc ~150 degrees, reach 50 u); wind-up 0.35 |\n| `fury` | 2.2 | once | roar: arms wide, head back, 0.65-1.7 s |\n| `aggro` | 1.2 | once | points the cleaver at the target |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch |\n| `death` | 1.6 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 (cleaver lies flat) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 46.2 u/s (1.30 m/s), cycle 1.1 s, 50.8 u per cycle\n- `run`: 128.0 u/s (3.60 m/s), cycle 0.7 s, 89.6 u per cycle\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_cleave`: key 0.55 s: flat sweep right-to-left in front (hits an arc ~150 degrees, reach 50 u); wind-up 0.35\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 78, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 55.5, 8.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (5.5, 60.5, 8.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (9.5, 67.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 53, -8.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (16.5, 33.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-21.5, 44, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-16.5, 33.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (10, 40, 5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-10, 40, 5)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `cleaver` (visible, under slot_hand_r): jagged black iron cleaver, blade 30 u (85 cm) long, grip at the origin, blade along -Z, edge along -Y\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l and glow_crack_* are the lit cubes.\n"},"description":"# fiend\n\nFiend (C2), walker, 2.2 m = 78 u to the top of the head (horn curls to 84 u).\n\nA heavily muscled red demon soldier: brick-red skin with glowing orange cracks, curled black horns, a fanged underbite, burning yellow eyes, an iron shoulder plate with a spike on a chest strap, an iron-banded leather loincloth, black claws and a jagged black iron cleaver. Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names (scaled up).\n\n- Cubes: 39 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -22.0..20.0, y 0.0..82.0, z -8.0..7.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 30 x 80 x 18 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1.1 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.7 | loop |  |\n| `attack_cleave` | 1.3 | once | key 0.55 s: flat sweep right-to-left in front (hits an arc ~150 degrees, reach 50 u); wind-up 0.35 |\n| `fury` | 2.2 | once | roar: arms wide, head back, 0.65-1.7 s |\n| `aggro` | 1.2 | once | points the cleaver at the target |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch |\n| `death` | 1.6 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 (cleaver lies flat) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 46.2 u/s (1.30 m/s), cycle 1.1 s, 50.8 u per cycle\n- `run`: 128.0 u/s (3.60 m/s), cycle 0.7 s, 89.6 u per cycle\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_cleave`: key 0.55 s: flat sweep right-to-left in front (hits an arc ~150 degrees, reach 50 u); wind-up 0.35\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 78, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 55.5, 8.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (5.5, 60.5, 8.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (9.5, 67.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 53, -8.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (16.5, 33.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-21.5, 44, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-16.5, 33.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (10, 40, 5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-10, 40, 5)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `cleaver` (visible, under slot_hand_r): jagged black iron cleaver, blade 30 u (85 cm) long, grip at the origin, blade along -Z, edge along -Y\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l and glow_crack_* are the lit cubes.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-9.0,37.0,-5.5],"to":[9.0,44.0,5.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,37.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[90,84,108.0,91.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,93,11.0,100.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[108,84,126.0,91.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[11,93,22.0,100.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[91,59,109.0,70.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[109,59,127.0,70.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"9b8c9484-5fee-5399-a9c0-90c7ab406b03"},{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-13.0,44.0,-7.0],"to":[13.0,66.0,7.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,44.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[2,0,28.0,22.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[54,0,68.0,22.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[28,0,54.0,22.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[68,0,82.0,22.0],"texture":0